{"id":"n62099-1-8","stage":3,"title":"종교 · 宗教","scene":"文化与信仰","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n62099-1-8-1","ko":"기독교인이라고 하셨나요?","zh":"您是基督徒吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"기독교인이라고","meaning":"基督徒","explanation":"기독교인：基督徒；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；라고：引用命令或名词判断；要与前后引用表达连用。","readings":[{"term":"기독교인","audio":"/audio/9c9c034be12b0ff81e5d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"37955","senseId":"1","lemma":"기독교인","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"하셨나요?","meaning":"表示引用。","explanation":"하다：表示引用。；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；나요：礼貌、委婉地询问。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"22","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"9c9c034be12b0ff8","term":"기독교인","zh":"基督徒","audio":"/audio/9c9c034be12b0ff81e5d.mp3","entryId":"37955","definition":"信仰基督教的人。","pronunciation":["기독꾜인"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"表示引用。","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"表示引用。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/4e2538d08f3246b4718a.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n62099-1-8-2","ko":"아니요. 저는 종교를 가지고 있지 않습니다.","zh":"不是的。我没有信仰任何宗教。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아니요.","meaning":"不是，不用","explanation":"아니요：不是，不用","readings":[{"term":"아니요","audio":"/audio/9474acc7539b7e2cedaf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17189","senseId":"1","lemma":"아니요","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"저는","meaning":"我","explanation":"저：我；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44506","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"종교를","meaning":"宗教","explanation":"종교：宗教；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"종교","audio":"/audio/51091882576ac7c1da81.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62099","senseId":"1","lemma":"종교","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"가지고","meaning":"怀有，感","explanation":"가지다：怀有，感；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"가지다","audio":"/audio/f3b684d86e5485ededb3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65234","senseId":"11","lemma":"가지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있지","meaning":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","explanation":"있다：正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）；지：连接后续表达，可形成对照；与 않다、못하다、말다 等合用时表示否定、不能或禁止。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"않습니다.","meaning":"不","explanation":"않다：不；습니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"않다","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71581","senseId":"1","lemma":"않다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"9474acc7539b7e2c","term":"아니요","zh":"不是，不用","audio":"/audio/9474acc7539b7e2cedaf.mp3","entryId":"17189","definition":"用于否定回答长辈所提出的问题。","pronunciation":["아니요"]},{"id":"ac0e9ef613fd92c8","term":"저","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3","entryId":"44506","definition":"说话人在听话人面前对自己的谦称。","pronunciation":["저"]},{"id":"51091882576ac7c1","term":"종교","zh":"宗教","audio":"/audio/51091882576ac7c1da81.mp3","entryId":"62099","definition":"相信并服从于上帝或超自然控制者的存在，并把这一信仰当作生活及哲学之根本的文化体系。","pronunciation":["종교"]},{"id":"f3b684d86e5485ed","term":"가지다","zh":"怀有，感","audio":"/audio/f3b684d86e5485ededb3.mp3","entryId":"65234","definition":"心里有想法、态度、思想等。","pronunciation":["가지다"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"62595","definition":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"b69b8939cafeac28","term":"않다","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3","entryId":"71581","definition":"用于否定前文所指的行为。","pronunciation":["안타"]}],"audio":"/audio/8d4875f78e39544c73b3.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.223,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=62099","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.o